{"page":478,"verses":[{"verse_key":"41:12","surah":41,"ayah":12,"ar_uthmani":"فَقَضَىٰهُنَّ سَبْعَ سَمَـٰوَاتٍ فِى يَوْمَيْنِ وَأَوْحَىٰ فِى كُلِّ سَمَآءٍ أَمْرَهَا ۚ وَزَيَّنَّا ٱلسَّمَآءَ ٱلدُّنْيَا بِمَصَـٰبِيحَ وَحِفْظًا ۚ ذَٰلِكَ تَقْدِيرُ ٱلْعَزِيزِ ٱلْعَلِيمِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and in two Days He formed seven heavens, and assigned an order to each. We have made the nearest one beautifully illuminated and secure. Such is the design of the Almighty, the All Knowing.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَقَضَىٰهُنَّ","en_gloss":"Then He completed them","transliteration":"faqaḍāhunna","verse_key":"41:12"},{"pos":2,"ar":"سَبْعَ","en_gloss":"(as) seven","transliteration":"sabʿa","verse_key":"41:12"},{"pos":3,"ar":"سَمَـٰوَاتٍۢ","en_gloss":"heavens","transliteration":"samāwātin","verse_key":"41:12"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"41:12"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يَوْمَيْنِ","en_gloss":"two periods","transliteration":"yawmayni","verse_key":"41:12"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَأَوْحَىٰ","en_gloss":"and He revealed","transliteration":"wa-awḥā","verse_key":"41:12"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"41:12"},{"pos":8,"ar":"كُلِّ","en_gloss":"each","transliteration":"kulli","verse_key":"41:12"},{"pos":9,"ar":"سَمَآءٍ","en_gloss":"heaven","transliteration":"samāin","verse_key":"41:12"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَمْرَهَا ۚ","en_gloss":"its affair","transliteration":"amrahā","verse_key":"41:12"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَزَيَّنَّا","en_gloss":"And We adorned","transliteration":"wazayyannā","verse_key":"41:12"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَآءَ","en_gloss":"the heaven","transliteration":"l-samāa","verse_key":"41:12"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","en_gloss":"[the world]","transliteration":"l-dun'yā","verse_key":"41:12"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بِمَصَـٰبِيحَ","en_gloss":"with lamps","transliteration":"bimaṣābīḥa","verse_key":"41:12"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَحِفْظًۭا ۚ","en_gloss":"and (to) guard","transliteration":"waḥif'ẓan","verse_key":"41:12"},{"pos":16