 loose on them for a few disastrous days to make them taste the punishment of shame in this world; more shameful still will be the punishment of the life to come, and they will not be helped.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَأَرْسَلْنَا","en_gloss":"So We sent","transliteration":"fa-arsalnā","verse_key":"41:16"},{"pos":2,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمْ","en_gloss":"upon them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","verse_key":"41:16"},{"pos":3,"ar":"رِيحًۭا","en_gloss":"a wind","transliteration":"rīḥan","verse_key":"41:16"},{"pos":4,"ar":"صَرْصَرًۭا","en_gloss":"furious","transliteration":"ṣarṣaran","verse_key":"41:16"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فِىٓ","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"41:16"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَيَّامٍۢ","en_gloss":"(the) days","transliteration":"ayyāmin","verse_key":"41:16"},{"pos":7,"ar":"نَّحِسَاتٍۢ","en_gloss":"(of) misfortune","transliteration":"naḥisātin","verse_key":"41:16"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لِّنُذِيقَهُمْ","en_gloss":"that We may make them taste","transliteration":"linudhīqahum","verse_key":"41:16"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عَذَابَ","en_gloss":"(the) punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhāba","verse_key":"41:16"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْخِزْىِ","en_gloss":"(of) disgrace","transliteration":"l-khiz'yi","verse_key":"41:16"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"41:16"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","en_gloss":"the life","transliteration":"l-ḥayati","verse_key":"41:16"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلدُّنْيَا ۖ","en_gloss":"(of) the world","transliteration":"l-dun'yā","verse_key":"41:16"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَلَعَذَابُ","en_gloss":"And surely, (the) punishment","transliteration":"walaʿadhābu","verse_key":"41:16"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Hereafter","transliteration":"l-ākhirati","verse_key":"41:16"},{"pos":16,"ar":"أَخْزَىٰ ۖ","en_gloss":"(is) more disgracing","transliteration":"akhzā","verse_key":"41:16"},{"pos":17,"ar":"وَهُمْ","en_gloss":"and they","transliteration":"wahum","verse_key":"41:16"},{"pos":18,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"will not be helpe